      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: This is still a problem and can be reproduced as soon as the master client becomes unresponsive and does not send any events. The player gets loaded into the instance, the logfile contains\n\nError      -  [VRCFlowManagerVRC] Master is not sending any events! Moving to a new instance.\nError      -  [VRCFlowManagerVRC] Did not recieve initial events\nLog        -  [VRCFlowManagerVRC] Resetting game flow because \"Failed to finish initial load\": [TryAlternateInstance, SkipLogin]\n\nThe problem can be easily reproduced by making a second client join an instance while having VRChat.exe on the master client frozen/suspended (e.g. with Windows Sysinternals Process Explorer)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
