      "value": "@{5b8cc39b2734df12abfb8347|full_name}: This occurs on Live as well with an unresponsive Master, and this is expected behavior when a master goes unresponsive.\n\nAre you stating that the new behavior is that \"joining user actually is in the instance with other users for a moment, but doesn't realize it (with voice and IK being sent), and gets kicked to a new instance eventually once their client determines master is unresponsive\"?",
