      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Attempting to gather more information. Here is the precise case I am trying to see if can be replicated on Open Beta:\n\nClient A: Frozen master\nClient B: attempting to join\nClient C: already in instance\n\nWhen B joins instance, client C can hear B, even though B cannot see the instance. Client B eventually gets kicked from instance. Client C is still in instance and is fine.",
