      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This isn't new, I used to experience it at least several times a week loading into the Pug on live. People would see me appear, I'd seem to be \"live\" for them but in reality I'm still initializing and eventually just get booted back to a loading screen then into a new instance.\nIt's almost like it times out syncing everything already in the world because it was always busy instances that this happened in.",
